<title>POLAND: DROSED TO ISSUE PLN 1.0 MLN CPS.</title>
<headline>DROSED TO ISSUE PLN 1.0 MLN CPS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish poultry producer Siedleckie Zaklady Drobiarskie Drosed SA plans to issue one million zlotys worth 35-day commercial papers, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>It said it had signed an agreement with Polish Polski Bank Inwestycyjny on the issue.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
